**Component:** `include/strata/artifact/dequant.hpp`

**Responsibilities:** Scalar reference dequantizers for every encoding the engine reads. Currently covers Q2_0, Q8_0, Q4_0, Q5_0, IQ4_NL, Q6_K, Q4_K, Q5_K, Q3_K, IQ4_XS, F32, F16, BF16. Q2_K (type 10, 256 elements, 84 bytes) is in `block_geometry` but has no dequantizer, so `--check` on a file containing Q2_K tensors silently skips them.

**Proposed change:** Add `dequantize_q2_K` transcribed from ggml-quants.c at the pinned commit.

